      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-06T18:57:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is UART_PARITY_EVEN_0?  A comment below indicates that the other UART_PARITY_EVEN_1 is \"conventional\", but what is this then?",
      "revId": "35217913716aaeb0939615858c8987fd19734d1c",
